    given-names: "Sadeq"
version: "0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SadeqEbrahimiLive/FTN-RRC-Turbo-Equalization"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB faster-than-Nyquist simulation with root-raised-cosine pulse shaping,
  equivalent Forney-factor ISI channel, reduced-memory M-ary BCJR equalization,
  iterative convolutional BCJR decoding, spectral diagnostics, and BER estimation.
keywords:
  - faster-than-Nyquist signaling
  - root-raised-cosine pulse shaping
  - turbo equalization
  - BCJR
  - MATLAB
